abstract: >-
  Interactive 3D viewer and architecture simulator for fault-tolerant
  quantum computation with reconfigurable atomic qubits. Based on
  "Shor's algorithm is possible with as few as 10,000 reconfigurable
  atomic qubits" by Cain, Xu, King et al. (Oratomic/Caltech, 2025).
